  message: "[Wave-0 pending-validation sweep] Invariant satisfied. Two-layer structural fix deployed in commit afcaca625:\n- Layer 1 (launch-side): same-SID idempotence guard kills prior watcher before launching new one (.agent/hooks/_shared/launch-transcript-sync.sh:49-86, mirrors kill-transcript-sync.sh two-phase pattern)\n- Layer 2 (filter-side): fcntl.flock(LOCK_EX) serializes concurrent filter-transcript.py invocations on state file (.agent/hooks/_shared/filter-transcript.py:259-274)\n\nAll 34 tests pass (test_watcher_lifecycle.py + test_filter_transcript.py). Concurrent invocation safety verified: 50-row source produces exactly 50 rows in dest (no 2x doubling). Lock mechanism confirmed to block concurrent writers. Guard mechanism verified to kill prior watchers and register new PID."  # ccd6
